  "worked_solution": "Notice that the sets are disjoint since\n\n$$\n{2,4,6}\\cap {1,3,5}=\u2205.\n$$\n\nTherefore, the disjoint union is simply the union:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{2,4,6}\u2294{1,3,5} & ={2,4,6}\\cup {1,3,5} \\\\  & ={1,2,3,4,5,6}\\end{aligned}\n$$",
